The NIfTI files in this folder are 2 mm versions of

  * the ICBM 2009c nonlinear symmetric template tissue probability maps
    (Fonov et al., NeuroImage 2011), and
  * the CerebrA atlas (Manera et al., Scientific Data 2020),

both distributed by the McConnell Brain Imaging Centre under the following
terms. They were produced with scripts/build_atlas.py.

